    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated just off the Dublin Road, adjacent to Knightsbrook Hotel, Spa and Golf Club, this B rated property offers spacious family living in a convenient location. A short stroll into the centre of Trim town with shops, hotels, coffee shops, sporting and recreational amenities including the popular Porchfields walking route along the river Boyne.\nFacing a well maintained open green area with parking spaces provided.\nAccommodation includes sitting room with double doors into kitchen/dining, utility room and guest WC on the ground floor and 4 bedrooms, ensuite and family bathroom upstairs.\nThe southwest facing rear garden, with its own separate side entrance is ideal for BBQs and family gatherings.\nAn opportunity to acquire a well maintained 4 bedroom property with a B energy rating, located just off the Dublin Road and bus stop - an ideal purchase for the first time buyer, investor or retiree.\nEarly viewing is recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nHardwood front door, laminate wood floor, ceiling coving.\n\nSitting Room - \nOak fire surround with cream marble inser and piped for gas, laminate wood flooring, ceiling coving and recessed lighting, double doors open into kitchen.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - \nRange of fitted wall and floor kichen units with Hoover fridge freezer, Candy built-in electric oven and 4 ring gas hob. 'A 'rated Kenwood integrated dishwasher, tiled over countertop and tiled floor.\n\nUtility Room - \nCountertop with tiled splashback and sink unit, LG washing machine and Hotpoint clothes dryer, tiled floor, door to rear garden.\n\nGuest Toilet - \nWash hand basin, WC, part-tiled walls and tiled floor.\n\nLanding - \nCarpeted floor, hotpress with laminate floor and immersion heater.\n\nBedroom 1 - \nFitted 4 door wardrobe, laminate wood flooring.\n\nEn-Suite - \nWash hand basin with mixer tap, fitted shower unit with mains shower, part-tiled walls and vinyl floor covering.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nFtted 2 door wardrobe, carpeted floor.\n\nBedroom 3 - \nLaminate wood flooring.\n\nBedroom 4 - \nCarpeted floor.\n\nBathroom - \nPpanelled bath with Triton T80z instant electric unit, WC, wash hand basin, part-tiled walls and vinyl floor covering.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>All mains services are provided</li><li>Natural gas heating</li><li>B energy rated - ideal for Green mortgage</li><li>Wooden side gate to rear garden</li><li>Southwest facing rear garden</li><li>Wooden garden shed</li><li>Outside tap</li><li>Smoke alarms</li><li>Car parking spaces</li><li>Facing a well maintained open green area</li><li>Located close to Dublin bus route for work and college</li><li>Adjacent to Knightsbrook Hotel, Spa & Golf Club</li><li>15kms to M3 Motorway</ul>"
      },
      {
